  "job_B1.8.4.4_20251001_193259": {
    "chunk_text": "buton Mathian anes, \u00fee ic ofacsian ne mihte: \u00f0a Iohannes leofode on \u00feisum life heora lengst, & he awrat \u00fea boc on his wr\u00e6csi\u00f0e Apocalipsis gehaten, Ic m\u00e6g \u00fee secgan git sum \u00feing be Iohannes, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu wylt gelyfan, \u00fe\u00e6t he mid weorcum spr\u00e6c to Hieronimus se wur\u00fefulla & se wisa bocere, \u00fee ure bibliothecan gebrohte to Ledene of Greciscum Gehyr \u00f0u \u00feas race, na swilce lease sagu, ac geworden \u00feing be Iohanne \u00f0am apostole & swi\u00fee Domicianus hatte se deoflica casere, \u00fee \u00e6fter Nerone \u00fea re\u00f0an ehtnyssa besette on \u00feam cristenum, & Se het genyman \u00feone halgan apostol & on weallendum ele he het hine ba\u00f0ian, for \u00f0an \u00fee se hata ele Hig gebrohton \u00fea Iohannem binnan \u00fe\u00e6re cyfe on \u00feam weallendan ele; ac he wear\u00f0 gescild \u00feurh \u00c6fter \u00feisum gehet se hetola casere, for \u00f0an \u00f0e Iohannes nolde his bodunge geswican, \u00fe\u00e6t man hine Wear\u00f0 \u00fea eft gelangod se geleaffulla apostol of \u00feam iglande ham to Ephesan byrig, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r he \u00d0a \u00e6fter sumum fyrste ferde se apostol, swa swa he gela\u00f0od w\u00e6s \u00feurh \u00fea geleaffullan, to gehendum He becom \u00fea to anre birig, swa swa he gebeden w\u00e6s, gehende Ephesan, & \u00fe\u00e6r bisceop gehadode, & \u00d0a geseah Iohannes sumne cniht on \u00feam folce iunglicre ylde & \u00e6nlices hiwes, stranglic on w\u00e6stme \u00d0a bese",
